Short:        ZLib Port to WarpOS
Author:       gzip@prep.ai.mit.edu,madler@alumni.caltech.edu,MagicSN@Birdland.es.bawue.de (port)
Uploader:     MagicSN Birdland es bawue de
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: generic

ZLib is a Compression Software from Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler for example needed
in the PNG Format and for gzip. This Source-Archive contains sources adapted for the
usage in StormC PPC (Adaption done by me, original software by Jean-loup Gailly and
Mark Adler). A Project File is not included.
